{"id":"taman_o","lemma":"tamaño","pos":"adj","rank":1289,"glosses":["as big or small; equivalent in size; so big/so small; such a big/small"],"ipa":"/taˈmaɲo/","forms":{"feminine":"tamaña","masculinePlural":"tamaños","femininePlural":"tamañas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-tama%C3%B1o.wav","examples":[{"text":"Son más o menos del mismo tamaño.","en":"They are more or less the same size.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692152","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,4,"give or take"],[4,6,"thereof"]]},{"text":"Es del tamaño perfecto.","en":"It's the perfect size.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461543","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of the"},null,{"g":"perfect"}]},{"text":"¿De qué tamaño es tu jardín?","en":"How big is your garden?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461931","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"garden"}]},{"text":"Tengo martillos de varios tamaños.","en":"I have hammers of different sizes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567564","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"hammer","l":"martillo"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"various, several"},null]},{"text":"No puede haber dicho tamaña estupidez.","en":"He can't have said such a stupid thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609075","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"saying, expression"},null,{"g":"stupidity"}]}]}